The following changes are needed to pull docker file and run while app is up
# 1. Create the docker group (it might already exist)
sudo groupadd docker
# 2. Add your user account to the docker group
sudo usermod -aG docker gunitha
# 3. Apply the group changes to your current terminal session immediately
newgrp docker
sudo chmod 666 /var/run/docker.sock
id
su - gunitha